+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-copy">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>Last updated: October 23, 2026</p>
+    <p>You can browse this website without providing personal information.</p>
+    <h2>Only what is needed</h2>
+    <p>These static pages have no forms, analytics, advertising trackers, or client-side scripts. They do not set cookies, use browser storage, or request your location, camera, or microphone.</p>
+    <h2>No third-party resources</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served from this website. Visiting these pages does not load external fonts, social widgets, or embedded services, or send page-view events to analytics providers.</p>
+    <h2>Delivering the website</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends connection information, including your IP address, to the hosting provider to receive these pages. The provider may keep operational or security logs. This website's source code does not control the provider's logging or retention settings.</p>
+    <h2>Links and future services</h2>
+    <p>This notice covers the static home and privacy pages. Account, rewards, and ordering services are not implemented here. Any future service that collects information must explain its purpose, required fields, retention, and your choices before collection begins.</p>
+    <p><a href="/">Return to The Daily Grind</a></p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
